  "content": "<h2>Zegarn PvP 資源包</h2><p>專注於<strong>清晰、舒適和乾淨視覺</strong>的極簡風格 PvP 資源包。</p><p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpvp-zegarn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 取得更快的更新</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252f7Km7EkeKcx7sAbDv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報錯誤或提出建議</a></span></p><h2>✦ 更新內容</h2><p><strong>1.3.4</strong></p><ul>\n<li>新圖標</li>\n<li>新全景選單 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c5ac2780a357a5679a1033cf11852c0f5426512_0.webp\" alt=\"全景\"></li>\n</ul><p><strong>1.3.3</strong></p><ul>\n<li>新的物品欄高亮效果</li>\n<li>新的提示框背景</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 特色功能</h2><p><strong>視覺效果</strong></p><ul>\n<li>乾淨簡潔的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色 UI 主題</li>\n<li>自訂準心</li>\n<li>自訂天空</li>\n<li>自訂主選單與全景</li>\n</ul><p><strong>紋理</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重製的盔甲、物品與方塊</li>\n<li>重製的不死圖騰</li>\n<li>更新的終界水晶</li>\n<li>重製的盾牌紋理</li>\n<li>更新的粉雪</li>\n<li>縮小的火焰</li>\n</ul><p><strong>遊戲體驗改善</strong></p><ul>\n<li>作物生長進度指示器</li>\n<li>生命值與飽食度重新著色</li>\n<li>紅石微調</li>\n</ul><p><strong>音效</strong></p><ul>\n<li>自訂音效（已更新與精煉）</li>\n</ul><p><strong>UI / 介面</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新設計的背包</li>\n<li>提示框與高亮效果改進</li>\n<li>更簡潔的介面元素</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 需求</h2><p><strong>天空（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p><p><strong>天空（Fabric）：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 俄語版本</h2><h2>✦ 特色功能</h2><p><strong>視覺效果</strong></p><ul>\n<li>乾淨簡潔的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色 UI 主題</li>\n<li>自訂準心</li>\n<li>自訂天空</li>\n<li>自訂主選單與全景</li>\n</ul><p><strong>紋理</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重製的盔甲、物品與方塊</li>\n<li>重製的不死圖騰</li>\n<li>更新的終界水晶</li>\n<li>重製的盾牌紋理</li>\n<li>更新的粉雪</li>\n<li>縮小的火焰</li>\n</ul><p><strong>遊戲體驗改善</strong></p><ul>\n<li>作物生長進度指示器</li>\n<li>生命值與飽食度重新著色</li>\n<li>紅石微調</li>\n</ul><p><strong>音效</strong></p><ul>\n<li>自訂音效（已更新與精煉）</li>\n</ul><p><strong>UI / 介面</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新設計的背包</li>\n<li>提示框與高亮效果改進</li>\n<li>更簡潔的介面元素</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 需求</h2><p><strong>天空（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p><p><strong>天空（Fabric）：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ Credits</h2><p>部分方塊紋理基於：<span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></span></p>",
